==== Installation using CFE bootloader with serial and TFTP ====

->  [[docs:guide-user:installation:generic.flashing.tftp]]

Unfortunately the stock Sky firmware requires signed firmware binaries.

We thus have to use the bootloader to flash OpenWrt to the router, which is only accessible via the serial interface inside the case.

Note: To flash OpenWrt we need to erase the flash first (not the bootloader though). This will also delete configuration data used by the Sky firmware.

=== Specific values you need ===

^ Bootloader tftp client IPv4 address   | 192.168.1.1                         |
^ TFTP default image name               | Rename file to bcm963xx_fs_kernel   |
^ TFTP Server default IP Address        | 192.168.1.100                       |

