===== Basic configuration =====
-> [[docs:guide-quick-start:checks_and_troubleshooting|Basic configuration]] After flashing, proceed with this.\\
Set up your Internet connection, configure wireless, configure USB port, etc.


===== Specific Configuration =====
==== Interfaces ====

The default network configuration is:
^ Interface Name ^ Description ^ Default configuration ^
| br-lan | LAN & WiFi | 192.168.1.1/24 | 
| vlan0 (eth0.0) | LAN ports (1 to 4) | None | 

No WiFi interface is available at this time as an open driver for Broadcom 6361/6362 chips is unavailable.

==== Switch Ports (for VLANs) ====
Numbers 0-3 are Ports 1-4 as labeled on the unit, 8 is the internal connection to the router itself.
^ Port             ^ Switch port   ^
| internal (CPU)   | 8             |
| LAN 1            | 0             |
| LAN 2            | 1             |
| LAN 3            | 2             |
| LAN 4            | 3             |

