==== Opening the case ====
**Note:** This will void your warranty!

To remove the cover, unscrew the four screws holding together the upper and lower plate.
They are located underneath the four rubber feet on the bottom of the router.


==== Serial ====
-> [[docs:techref:hardware:port.serial]] general information about the serial port, serial port cable, etc.

There are solder pads for the 3.3V TTL UART on the PCB.

Once connected, set your terminal program to 115200 baud, 8 data bits, no parity, 1 stop bit.

