===== Debricking =====
-> [[docs:guide-user:troubleshooting:generic.debrick]]

As long as the CFE bootloader is not deliberately overwritten, it is easy to erase and reflash the router's flash memory using a serial terminal and a TFTP server.

See the CFE flashing instructions above.

